; Plan 04's RULE 3: the chunk's first record carries envelope version 2
; and this build reads version 1.
;
; One byte of `residue-it-exact`'s file is different (`tools/gen_fixtures.zig`
; re-stamps the head), and that byte changes everything: the payload is
; not parsed at all, the timeline tier is DERIVED, and the document opens
; with "the residue is a newer version and was left in the file". A
; `build` of that document keeps the payload where it is and writes none
; of its own unless `--force-residue` — which is `residue_newer_kept`,
; pinned by the CLI's own tests.
(read)
(dump)
